      "role": "user",
      "content": "but is it really that urgent? he's not crying or anything, just really out of it. i'm worried he'll be scared of the hospital and i'm just so tired of running to the clinic every time he gets a tiny bug. couldn't i just try some pedialyte or even just regular water first and see if he wakes up in an hour?",
